{
  "schema": "xbench.budgets.v1",
  "about": "cmux NEXT heavy-session budgets (speed-of-sound-DESIGN.md section 4): 150 workspaces, 20 hidden terminals, 20 hidden Chromium tabs. Run with --arg=budgets=scripts/perf-bench/budgets-heavy.json. All advisory until the base holds them.",
